   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Hello everyone!</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">I&#39;m a little confused about how the function &quot;deployApp()&quot; understands the borders of the app to upload. In my ui.R file, I have a link to help/index.html (my slidified doc file), made with</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:10px;font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;margin-bottom:10.5px;line-height:21px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902);background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;color:inherit;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\">tags$a(href=&quot;help/index.html&quot;, &quot;Read the Documentation!&quot;),</code></pre><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">But, when I try and click, the link is broken, because the html file is missing on the Shinyapp server.</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">How should that work?</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Or I&#39;m just not supposed to upload on shinyapp any non-shinyapp file?</span><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Thank you in advance.</span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
